<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45503" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὖχος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔχομαι</span>) poet.
		Noun: <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>thing prayed for, object of prayer</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὖχος δοῦναι, ὀρέξαι, πορεῖν τινι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.285
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				22.130
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				22.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1203
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὖχος ἀρέσθαι</span> to obtain
				<i>it</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				7.203
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Tyrt.
					12.36
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				5.21
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τεῦκρον . . εὖχος
			ἀπηύρα</span> took <i>it</i> away from him, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.462
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>boast, vaunt</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλεον δέ οἱ εὖχος ἔδωκας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					21.473
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὖχος ἔργῳ καθελών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					10(11).63
				</span></i>
			, al.; of persons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀνάκρεον, εὖ. Ἰώνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.27
				</span></i>
			 (Antip. Sid.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> later, <i>vow, votive offering</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Epigr.</u>
				5.3
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
